column2:
) .  They should be natural and interesting, yeah, but basically background-y.  A lot of players can't make a choice and listen to the idle at the same time.  We don't want to pull their attention in two different directions.

And, idles should never ever move the story ball forward.  Cool important stuff belongs in the mainline.

All IMHO, feel free to disagree!

